  "description": "Paperwork.Core generates PDF documents from templates. It turns HTML templates with CSS styles and SVG drawing, bound to your data, into PDF documents - with flowing pages, data binding, and referenced images, stylesheets and fonts - on .NET and in Blazor WASM.\n\nIt adds a fluent builder, dependency injection and code configuration on top of the Scryber.Core rendering engine. Paperwork.Core is the successor to Scryber.Core, and your Scryber templates carry straight across.\n\nReleased under the MIT licence.",
